msgstr "ActBlue"

#: integrations/action_network.py:24
msgid ""
"Uncheck to temporarily disable Action Network without removing its "
"configuration."
msgstr ""
"Abwählen, um Action Network vorübergehend zu deaktivieren, ohne die "
"Konfiguration zu löschen."

#: integrations/action_network.py:28
msgid "Action Network API key"
msgstr "Action-Network-API-Schlüssel"

#: integrations/action_network.py:30
msgid ""
"Required for server-side Action Network integrations. Leave blank if using "
"the embed widget approach."
msgstr ""
"Erforderlich für serverseitige Action-Network-Integrationen. Leer lassen, "
"wenn das eingebettete Widget verwendet wird."

#: integrations/action_network.py:37 integrations/action_network.py:43
