"Uncheck to temporarily disable ActionKit without removing its configuration."
msgstr ""
"Abwählen, um ActionKit vorübergehend zu deaktivieren, ohne die Konfiguration"
" zu löschen."

#: integrations/actionkit.py:289
msgid "ActionKit hostname"
msgstr "ActionKit-Hostname"

#: integrations/actionkit.py:291
msgid ""
"Your ActionKit instance hostname, e.g. 'myorg.actionkit.com' (no scheme or "
"trailing slash needed)."
msgstr ""
"Der Hostname Ihrer ActionKit-Instanz, z. B. „myorg.actionkit.com“ (ohne "
"Schema und ohne abschließenden Schrägstrich)."

#: integrations/actionkit.py:296
msgid "ActionKit API username"
msgstr "ActionKit-API-Benutzername"

#: integrations/actionkit.py:297
msgid "The ActionKit REST API username used for HTTP Basic auth."
msgstr ""
"Der Benutzername der ActionKit-REST-API für die HTTP-Basic-"
"Authentifizierung."

#: integrations/actionkit.py:301
msgid "ActionKit API password"
msgstr "ActionKit-API-Passwort"

#: integrations/actionkit.py:303
msgid ""
"The ActionKit REST API password. In production, prefer the "
"WTRX_ACTIONKIT_API_PASSWORD environment variable, which overrides this value"
" so the secret is not stored in the database."
msgstr ""
